1. Implement missing classes (`PreferenceManager`, `FavoritesManager`).  
2. Add missing templates (`preferences.html`, `favorites.html`).  
3. Replace hardcoded secret key with environment variables.  
4. Add user feedback (flash messages) for actions.  
