|Case|:generate_travel_recommendations  
Pseudocode:  
```python
FUNCTION get_recommendations(username):
    IF preferences.txt AND destinations.txt EXIST:
        READ user_prefs (budget, activities, climate) from preferences.txt
        IF user_prefs EXISTS:
            READ destinations.txt line by line
            FOR each destination:
                EXTRACT name, activities, climate, cost
                IF cost <= budget AND activities match AND climate matches:
                    ADD to recommendations list
    RETURN recommendations

ROUTE /recommendations:
    IF user NOT logged in:
        REDIRECT to /login
    CALL get_recommendations(username)
    RENDER recommendations.html WITH recommendations
```
Key Libraries:  
- File I/O (`destinations.txt`) 每 Contains destination data.  
- Flask (`render_template`) 每 Displays recommendations.  

